+//   OP_SCISSOR             R.sc, R.has_sc       W
+//   state operations       S                    W  state_op's writes, mirrored (pcw_state) without its dirty flags, the combined-program ring or bh_fresh's write into the record
+//   OP_BIND_PROGRAM        S.bst, S.cprog       W
