+// DM_NVN_PAR=1: this submission's piece cuts, from the snapshots (pcw_sub): the first OP_SET_RT at least g_pc_draws draws after the previous cut (or the submission's start), at most
+// PC_MAX. A record that comes more than once (a list called twice) is passed over: the translator finds a planned cut by its record (pcp_at). So is one inside more than 16 calls
+// (the snapshot keeps 16 return addresses). A submission with the MetalFX frame interpolation (its dispatch work runs with no end barrier, mfx_on), the xv ledger (xv_on: carried in
