+}
+// Frames N1 and N2 (P4 with async compute on, DM_NVN_ASYNC_CS=1): a dispatch that writes AOFF (its copy encoder opens a window), then a pass of 175 draws on target 0 (mid-pass
+// cuts at 64 and 128) on a target with pool storage, begun without the dispatch wait. N1: the draws from 150 on (after the last cut) read AOFF (a vertex stream): the piece after the cut puts the dispatch wait
+// back as one thread does. N2: the draws from 25 on read AOFF: piece 0 puts the wait back inside the pass, before its cut, and each later piece, handed the window as it was at the
+// pass's begin, puts it again
+// (counted: dispatch waits put again after a cut)
